    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">String matching</span><span class=\"chip accent\">KMP</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/find-the-index-of-the-first-occurrence-in-a-string/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 28</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Find the Index of the First Occurrence in a String</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Brute force tries every start and is accepted here (O(n·m) with n, m ≤ 10<sup>4</sup>). The interview upgrade is KMP: after a mismatch, the needle's own prefix table says how much of the match survives, so the text pointer never moves back. O(n + m) time, O(m) space.</p>\n"
